            <title>[IGNITE-8439] IGNITE_JETTY_HOST doesn&apos;t work (probably never has)</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8439</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;GridJettyRestProtocol.java&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;public void start(GridRestProtocolHandler hnd)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;...&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;System.setProperty(IGNITE_JETTY_HOST, locHost.getHostAddress())&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;...&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;should be&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;if(System.getProperty(IGNITE_JETTY_HOST)==null) System.setProperty(IGNITE_JETTY_HOST, locHost.getHostAddress());&lt;/p&gt;</description>
